1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,680
把生日蜡烛准备好 因为...
Get the birthday candle ready, 'cause...

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,880
栗宝的胡萝卜蛋糕要登场啦
here comes Chestnut's carrot cake!

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,100
我知道要给他庆祝这特别的日子
I know we want this to be special,

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,760
但栗宝是只马
but Chestnut is a horse.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,180
每个他没被做成宜家肉丸的日子
Any day he's not being made into an Ikea meatball

6
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:16,760
都是过生日
is a birthday.

7
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:21,920
记得 虽然今年是他十岁生日
And remember, even though it's his tenth birthday,

8
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,340
但得假装是六岁生日哦
we have to pretend he's six

9
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,180
不然他一整周都会很不爽的
or he'll be in a bad mood all week.

10
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:28,860
惊喜
Surprise!

11
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:32,320
栗宝生日快乐
Happy birthday, Chestnut!

12
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,820
麦克斯 蜡烛应该是他来吹
Max! He was supposed to do that!

13
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,780
有啥关系 我知道他的愿望
What? I know what he wished for.

14
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,980
有一天 我们能生活在一个
That one day, he and I live in a world

15
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,300
我们的爱能获得认同
where our love is recognized

16
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,280
并像其他同性恋夫妻享受同等权利的世界
and we have the same rights as gay couples.

17
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:44,480
快吃吧 宝贝
There you go, baby.

18
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,880
你看 他的鞋掉了
Hey, look, his shoe just fell off.

19
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,559
有可能是他踢掉鞋子
Or maybe he kicked it off

20
00:00:49,559 --> 00:00:52,192
准备好来一场疯狂派对啦
'cause he's getting ready to partay.

21
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,800
这可怎么办啊
What are we gonna do?

22
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:54,860
我们没有钱了
We don't have any money.

23
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,720
我上周想要做按摩
I wanted a massage last week,

24
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,460
所以我坐公车时 就坐在一个
so I just sat next to someone on the bus

25
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,800
看起来会乱摸我的人旁边
who looked like he'd touch me.

26
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:03,120
我可能办法帮他换新鞋
I may have an idea how we can get 'em.

27
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,260
我在慕尼黑啤酒节钓的男人是个铁匠
A guy I picked up at Oktoberfest is a blacksmith.

28
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:07,760
我认为他是啦
At least I think he was.

29
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:09,260
我记得有皮围裙
I remember a leather apron

30
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:10,800
然后有个烧红的"铁棒"之类的
and something being heated in a fire.

31
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:28,020
我找到那个铁匠啦
Well, I found my blacksmith.

32
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:30,120
他现在跟用蜜蜂做衣服的
He now shares an artisan barn

33
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,840
一个女人合开一家工匠铺
with a lady who makes clothing out of bees.

34
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,460
现在我知道为什么我们小蛋糕店倒闭了
I guess that's why our cupcake shop didn't work.

35
00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:37,620
我们没有提供大众"需要"的服务
We weren't providing a service that everyone needs.

36
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:39,960
我看了看栗宝
I looked at our boy,

37
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:42,360
他不只需要新的四只鞋子
and not only does Chestnut need four new shoes,

38
00:01:42,580 --> 00:01:43,860
他还有香港蹄
He has a hoof fungus.

39
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:46,640
香港蹄 好贫民区风啊
A hoof fungus? That's so ghetto.

40
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:48,980
我很确定是我害的
I'm pretty sure he got it from me

41
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:50,100
我们一起洗澡时传染的吧
because we shower together.

42
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:53,840
新马蹄加兽医费用总计要一千四
And the cost of new shoes and vet fee? $1,400.

43
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,240
麦克斯 我好惭愧
Max, I feel awful.

44
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,320
我是个坏母亲
I'm a bad mother.

45
00:01:57,740 --> 00:01:58,880
你才不是呢
You're not a bad mother.

46
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,840
我是坏母亲生出来的 所以我特了解
I know bad mothers. I came out of one.

47
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:05,060
姑娘们 那边是怎么回事
Ladies, what's happening over there?

48
00:02:05,580 --> 00:02:08,020
我一看到有超过两个白人在一起
You know a gathering of more than two white people

49
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:09,100
我就心惊肉跳
makes me nervous.

50
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:11,181
厄尔 其中一个是亚洲人啊
Earl, one of them's asian.

51
00:02:11,181 --> 00:02:13,816
都一样啦
Ah, same thing.

52
00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:16,300
这餐厅谁是管事的
Who would I talk to about the diner?

53
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,420
我们有兴趣想租下这地方
We're interested in renting this location

54
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:19,360
来拍电视剧
to film a TV show.

55
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:21,760
我们觉得这餐厅超适合当杀人现场
We think your diner would be a great place to kill someone.

56
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:23,560
我懂
I get it.

57
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:25,440
每次走进这餐厅 我内心都死去一部分
'Cause every time I come in here, I die a little.

58
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,338
这是我的名片
Here's my card.

59
00:02:27,338 --> 00:02:29,600
汤姆·吴 《法律与秩序 特殊受害者》剧组
Tom Woo, Law & Order: Special Victims Unit.

60
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:31,140
我勒个去 汤姆·吴
Shut your face, Tom Woo!

61
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:36,380
我爱死这剧了 尤其是《特殊受害者》系列
I love all the Law & Orders, especially SVU.

62
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,500
因为故事都是从新闻头条翻拍的
Their stories are ripped from the headlines,

63
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,320
我这人从不看报纸
and I don't read the newspaper,

64
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:41,320
所以你们就是我的新闻台啊
so that's where I get all my news.

65
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:43,560
很好 我去叫导演
Cool. Let me go get the director.

66
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:44,320
就是那边那位
That's him over there.

67
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:47,540
你看那导演多可爱
Look how cute the director is.

68
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:49,240
他符合我的粗犷男型呢
He's my rugged guy type.

69
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:50,540
也不是真粗汉子
Not really rugged at all,

70
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:52,520
只是从萨克斯第五大道精品百货里
but buys expensive, ruggedlooking clothing

71
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,580
买粗犷型名贵衣服的男人
from Saks 5th Avenue.

72
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,560
你好 我是迪杰·金斯利
Hi. DJ Kingsley.

73
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,620
胡子挺帅
Nice beard.

74
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:58,820
是自己长的呢
You grow out that stubble

75
00:02:58,820 --> 00:03:00,820
还是把剃须刀设置到"霸气男星"模式了
or just set your razor to "Jason Statham."

76
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,760
打扰一下 先生
Excuse me, sir.

77
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,780
你的相貌很出色
You've got a great face.

78
00:03:04,820 --> 00:03:06,140
您有当临演的经验吗
Have you ever done any extra work?

79
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:09,015
我出演过1973年经典电影
Well, I was in the 1973 classic

80
00:03:09,015 --> 00:03:12,000
《尖叫吧 博古拉》
Scream, blacula, scream.

81
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,700
女主演在电影中踹了我蛋蛋
Pam grier kicked me in the nuts

82
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,160
然后骂我是"装逼男"
and called me a "jive turkey."

83
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,580
希望您愿意考虑一下
If you'd consider it,

84
00:03:18,580 --> 00:03:20,140
我很乐意看到这集里有您出现
I'd love to have your look in the episode.

85
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,220
那我呢
Hey, what about me?

86
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,440
你可以要我剃光头 拖我到车后
You can shave my head, drag me behind a car,

87
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,100
或做任何我让人免费做过的事
or anything else I've already done for free.

88
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:28,420
没问题 而你想必是个女演员吧
Sure. And you must be an actress.

89
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,660
你太美 不可能只是个服务员
You're way too pretty to just be a waitress.

90
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:32,240
谢谢夸奖
Thank you!

91
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:34,840
其实我是有过一点表演经验啦
In fact I have done a little acting.

92
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:39,700
高中的时候 我扮演过《悲惨世界》里的芳汀
In high school, I portrayed Fantine in Les Miserables.

93
00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:43,540
听你那么念就让我觉得好"悲催"了
Just hearing you say that makes me "Miserobble."

94
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:46,500
怎么样呢
Well, how about it?

95
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,380
想跟我一起玩
You wanna hang with me

96
00:03:47,380 --> 00:03:49,100
然后在《特殊受害人》里当临演吗
and be an extra on Special Victims Unit?

97
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:50,620
付你112块一天
It pays 112 a day

98
00:03:50,620 --> 00:03:52,080
再加上你每天应挣得的小费
plus whatever you normally make in tips.

99
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:55,440
那就是112加3块 我愿意
Oh, so about 115? I'm in.

100
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:56,960
老娘要买新的"马鞋"啦
Mama needs a new pair of horseshoes.

101
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:58,860
那你们的话事人呢
So where's the boss?

102
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:01,400
我就是话事人 但我去叫这地方的店主来吧
I'm the boss, but I'll get the guy who owns the place.

103
00:04:02,311 --> 00:04:03,980
奥列格
Oleg!

104
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:05,500
他们要在这里拍电视剧
They're shooting a TV show here,

105
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:07,040
我的后脑勺或者我的侧乳
And the back of my head or the side of my boob

106
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:07,900
会入镜呢
is gonna be in it!

107
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:09,820
恭喜你啊 麦克斯
Good for you, Max.

108
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,400
我曾经上过乌克兰版《老大哥》
I was on Ukraine's version of big brother once,

109
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:15,000
其实就是乌克兰的每日生活
better known as just living in Ukraine.

110
00:04:16,977 --> 00:04:19,840
阿憨 《法律与秩序 特殊受害人》
Han! Law and order: Special Victims Unit

111
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,820
想来餐厅里拍摄 如果你不同意
wants to shoot in the diner, and if you don't say yes,

112
00:04:22,020 --> 00:04:23,840
我就会剁了你的"特殊受害鸡"
you'll be my special victim when I cut your unit off.

113
00:04:25,740 --> 00:04:26,680
求你答应了 阿憨
Please say yes, Han.

114
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:28,740
我们当当背景路人甲就有钱拿呢
They're gonna pay us to be in the background.

115
00:04:28,980 --> 00:04:30,240
但你们会演戏吗
But do you know how to act?

116
00:04:30,860 --> 00:04:31,880
我们还真会呢
Actually we do.

117
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:35,240
我懂"方法演技" 她懂"冰毒演技"[音似]
My acting's method, whereas hers is more meth head.

118
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:40,200
进来吧
Hey, come in.

119
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:40,960
记得
And remember,

120
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,800
如果他拒绝 完全是口是心非
if he says no, he doesn't mean it.

121
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,320
他只是希望你能多挑逗挑逗他
He just wants you to flirt with him a little bit.

122
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,400
话别说太早 麦克斯
Not so fast, Max.

123
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:49,420
我是李憨 这家点的老板与产权所有人
Hello, I'm Han Lee, the owner and proprietor.

124
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,560
还"产权所有人"呢
Oh, "proprietor."

125
00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:51,820
这五个字写起来比你身长还长[词深度]
That's word's bigger than you are.

126
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:55,680
你想要多少补偿费用
What kinda compensation do you want?

127
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,940
哎哟 我的亚洲兄弟
Whoa, whoa, my asian brother.

128
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:01,260
别这么直接 咱们慢慢来嘛
Slow down! Let's enjoy the dance.

129
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:02,580
我们想在这里拍摄
We'd like to shoot here.

130
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:04,320
这里的街头与骚气挺合适的
It's got the right amount of funk and skank.

131
00:05:04,580 --> 00:05:06,920
如果我们演得够好 出衍生剧
If we do real good in this and get a spinoff,

132
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,360
这就会是我们的剧名了吧
that'll be the name of our show

133
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,500
"街妹与骚妹"
Funk and skank.

134
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:12,280
好吧 但我不想当骚妹
Okay, but I don't wanna be skank.

135
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:14,280
绝对是姐当骚妹好吗
Oh, clearly I'm skank.

136
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,240
我想说 我很荣幸
And may I say I'm honored

137
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:19,840
能跟你这与我旗鼓相当的对手切磋生意
I have such a worthy opponent to barter with.

138
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,900
我是加州帕萨迪纳市长大的
Dude, I'm from Pasadena.

139
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,060
我真不敢相信
I can't believe this!

140
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,800
我没想过有一天我能上到一个
I never thought I'd be in a TV show

141
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,786
并没有一堆人喊着
where no one was yelling,

142
00:05:31,786 --> 00:05:33,752
"你不是她亲爹"的电视节目
"You are not the father!"

143
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:40,040
来吧 叫服务员临演出来
Let's go. Bring in the waitress extras.

144
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:42,720
我好喜欢这制服啊
Ooh, I love these uniforms!

145
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,760
感觉像《飞越比佛利》里的布兰达
I feel like Brenda from 90210

146
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:47,280
在核桃餐厅里打扮成50年代女服务员的样子
when she was dressed as that '50s waitress at the Peach Pit.

147
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,860
等我们成为巨星"街妹与骚妹"的时候
Well, when we're the big stars of funk and skank,

148
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:52,240
我们就不用穿任何制服了
we won't have to wear any uniforms.

149
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,880
等等 "街妹与骚妹"不是警察吗
But wait, aren't funk and skank cops?

150
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:57,020
不是 她们是妓女
Uh, no, they're hookers.

151
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,540
折衷一下吧
How about a compromise?

152
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,840
白天是警察 晚上是妓女如何
Cops by day, prostitutes by night?

153
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,420
所谓的警妓合一嘛
You know, copstitutes.

154
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,640
反正这俩行当 我们都是纽约最强的
Either way, we're New York's finest.

155
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:10,140
好了 大家准备 开始吧
Okay, everybody, ready! Here we go.

156
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,440
你看厄尔
Look at Earl over there.

157
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:13,660
厄尔 祝你好运
Good luck, Earl!

158
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:16,460
镜头对准门口 第八幕 第一次拍摄
Camera on the door. Scene eight, take one.

159
00:06:16,620 --> 00:06:18,560
开拍 杀手走进来
And action! Shooter comes in.

160
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,340
结束 很好 复位
And cut! Good! Reset.

161
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:28,460
厄尔 太激励人心了
Earl, that was inspiring.

162
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:31,540
希望大家看完后 都能对罪案袖手旁观
I hope everyone who sees you goes out and ignores a crime.

163
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:34,900
刚才那一幕 感觉你这收银员才是主角
It was like that scene was about the cash register guy.

164
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,480
你为这幕戏带来更多内涵
You really brought something extra.

165
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:37,840
我有闻到艾美奖的味道哦
I smell an Emmy.

166
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:39,860
纯粹是大麻味而已
Oh, that's weed.

167
00:06:41,260 --> 00:06:43,840
抱歉 让你们等着我们拍摄了
Hi. Sorry we haven't gotten to you guys yet.

168
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,040
你们何不去办公室里休息呢
Why don't you hang out in the office?

169
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:45,960
听说里面准备了上好寿司呢
I hear there's good sushi.

170
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:47,360
你看起来好漂亮
You look pretty.

171
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:50,920
导演好像对我有意思呢
I think the director kinda likes me.

172
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:53,140
心我不知道 但他的鸡鸡肯定对你有意思
Well, I don't know about him, but his penis does.

